      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 3.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "so, welcome make yourself comfortable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.61,
      "end_seconds": 5.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Evening, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.98,
      "end_seconds": 9.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "what do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.21,
      "end_seconds": 16.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "Um, so... a dry cough at night. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.3,
      "end_seconds": 21.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.94,
      "end_seconds": 31.32,
      "duration_seconds": 8.38,
      "text": "I've had it for two weeks. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.16,
      "end_seconds": 34.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.28,
      "end_seconds": 45.79,
      "duration_seconds": 10.51,
      "text": "I'd say a couple of times a week. Oh, and ankles puffing up. About ankles puffing up, it feels severe to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.0,
      "end_seconds": 57.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.48,
      "end_seconds": 66.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.22,
      "end_seconds": 69.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.57,
      "end_seconds": 82.0,
      "duration_seconds": 10.43,
      "text": "Sitagliptin. I take it 100 milligrams, once a day. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.89,
      "end_seconds": 84.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Okay, how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.04,
      "end_seconds": 91.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.22,
      "end_seconds": 95.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.97,
      "end_seconds": 99.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "My partner and our baby"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.1,
      "end_seconds": 102.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.25,
      "end_seconds": 108.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.76,
      "end_seconds": 110.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.41,
      "end_seconds": 115.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.36,
      "end_seconds": 127.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.42,
      "end_seconds": 130.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Diabetes, for about a year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.05,
      "end_seconds": 136.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.2,
      "end_seconds": 141.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Yes, I had my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.83,
      "end_seconds": 146.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "any wheezing or chest pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.76,
      "end_seconds": 151.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Uh, no, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.71,
      "end_seconds": 156.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Ah. Did you get coughing up blood or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.83,
      "end_seconds": 161.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Yeah, no, no coughing up blood or palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.85,
      "end_seconds": 165.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.03,
      "end_seconds": 169.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.37,
      "end_seconds": 174.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.2,
      "end_seconds": 177.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "nothing else aches"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.37,
      "end_seconds": 183.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "I'll just record a a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.17,
      "end_seconds": 198.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.88,
      "end_seconds": 214.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 108 over 69, pulse 65."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.72,
      "end_seconds": 221.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.82,
      "end_seconds": 223.52,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.39,
      "end_seconds": 229.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Alright, stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.6,
      "end_seconds": 245.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "Your BMI is on the high side and you look a little pale."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.61,
      "end_seconds": 250.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "you can relax now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.21,
      "end_seconds": 269.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "We should do blood tests for breathlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.64,
      "end_seconds": 273.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.71,
      "end_seconds": 307.7,
      "duration_seconds": 32.99,
      "text": "We should do a chest X-ray for breathlessness. A short daily walk, building up slowly, is a sensible start. I'm not ordering an echocardiogram today. If things carry on in a month, we'll consider it. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. Let's plan a check after the results are back. Let me check I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.56,
      "end_seconds": 315.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.06,
      "end_seconds": 322.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "yes, exactly right. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.07,
      "end_seconds": 329.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
}